  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK and guarantee due-diligence for Kosovo Credit and Guarantee Fund KCGF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISK and guarantee due-diligence for Kosovo Credit and Guarantee Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag syftar till att bed&#xf6;ma systemet f&#xf6;r intern kontroll av KCGF och KCGF:s samlade kapacitet att hantera en Sida-garanti. Konsulten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter. Baserat p&#xe5; resultaten kommer Sida att kr&#xe4;va att bristerna &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rdas p&#xe5; l&#xe4;mpligt s&#xe4;tt f&#xf6;re eller under avtalsfasen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims at assessing the system for internal control of KCGF and KCGF&#x2019;s overall capacity to manage a Sida guarantee. The consultant is expected to identify eventual weaknesses. Based on the findings, Sida will require that addresses the weaknesses as appropriate before or during the agreement phase.</narrative>
  </description>
